    Murmur, Old Croak: a vast old toad in the wells and the marshes, mostly heard: a deep croaking before rain. Its voice
    is the rain. Very rarely it surfaces in the wet ground, a toad the size of a house, and sinks again (Odyssey's colossus
    toad, by name, when it is loaded; GodRising).
  -->
  <ColonyCouncil.GodShapeDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_GodShape_Murmur</defName>
    <gods><li>Murmur</li><li>Rimfolk_God_Murmur</li></gods>
    <stranger>false</stranger>
    <beast>false</beast>
